 "description": "What shipment status has MHLW published for this prescription drug in Japan? Look up by YJ code, NHI price list code, or Japanese product or ingredient name. Returns the shipment status as published by MHLW (normal, limited shipment and its sub-category, supply suspended) with English labels as our translation, reason, outlook, manufacturer, MHLW dates and the previous status observed by this service. Relay only: not medical advice, not a statement about any pharmacy's stock.",
